  "title": {
   "en": "The Snow Leopard Baby of the Black Leopard Family"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "흑표 가문의 설표 아기님"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A child, born a hybrid and abused to death by her maternal grandfather, is reborn with memories of her past life. Faced with the same fate, she seeks out her estranged father for protection until adulthood. Expecting rejection, she is instead met with love and acceptance from her father, siblings, and grandfather—who even offers her the family leadership."
